  "description": "*\"I can make your life more fun.\"*\n\nA mysterious young man appeared one day in front of Yeo-Reum, who is living a dull life as a 30-year old! The way he acts straight-forward and to-the-point is very strong, kind of cute, but maybe a little overboard? What the hell do you want from me?! It's a heart-pounding, back-and-forth romance comedy! \n\n(Source: Naver Webtoon, translated)",
